  "goodToKnow": "Ebenbürtig means equal or on a par: ein ebenbürtiger Gegner, jemandem ebenbürtig sein (with the dative). Originally it meant of equal birth: noble families required ebenbürtige marriages, and unequal ones were morganatic. Today a similar idea is auf Augenhöhe (at eye level, as equals). Synonyms: gleichwertig, gleichrangig. The opposite is unterlegen (inferior)."
